WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.550
Unit 2 starts with what
Microsoft gives you.

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:07.503
Learn's service communications overview
names three list calls on Graph version one

3
00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:12.107
point oh: messages, for Message center
posts, which need Service Message dot Read

4
00:00:12.107 --> 00:00:14.409
dot All; and issues and health overviews,

5
00:00:14.409 --> 00:00:16.850
which need Service
Health dot Read dot All.

6
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.781
The kit keeps the health overviews
in the raw record for the run;

7
00:00:20.781 --> 00:00:23.200
the notices come from posts and issues.

8
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.562
Both permissions are granted
only by an administrator,

9
00:00:26.562 --> 00:00:29.413
and a delegated sign-in
also needs an admin role.

10
00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:33.812
One exception matters: data privacy
messages are visible only to Global

11
00:00:33.812 --> 00:00:37.039
Administrators and Message
Center Privacy Readers,

12
00:00:37.039 --> 00:00:40.338
so where they matter, name a
privacy reader to read them.

13
00:00:40.338 --> 00:00:45.199
And Learn has its own cmdlet for posts,
Get M g Service Announcement Message.

14
00:00:45.199 --> 00:00:49.850
It's the interim path before the reader
exists, and Lab 2's cross-check.
